# Deliberately empty of ignores.
#
# `cotal ext add ./plugin` runs `npm install --install-links`, which PACKS this directory. Without
# an .npmignore here npm falls back to a .gitignore — and the repo root ignores `dist/`, which is
# exactly the build output this package's `files` allowlist has to ship. An empty .npmignore takes
# precedence and ignores nothing; `files` in package.json is the allowlist.
